      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "From 1757, ferries linked Philadelphia and New York via Travis, which was called New Blazing Star Ferry during the Revolutionary era.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Travis%2C_Staten_Island",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Travis has celebrated an Independence Day parade every year since 1911, a tradition that still draws locals to the streets.",
