      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Travis%2C_Staten_Island",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Mid‑Island Little League from Travis captured the 1964 Little League World Series, a proud moment for the neighborhood.",
